WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.912 --> 00:00:08.852
(upbeat music)
(bell ringing)

00:00:08.852 --> 00:00:09.729
- Today we're going to pose

00:00:09.729 --> 00:00:11.900
like high fashion models
for the first time.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.581
(wind swooshing)

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:15.912
- High fashion modeling looks hard,

00:00:15.912 --> 00:00:17.869
looks very uncomfortable poses.

00:00:17.869 --> 00:00:18.857
- I'm an avid watcher

00:00:18.857 --> 00:00:20.278
of Victoria Secret Fashion Show.

00:00:20.278 --> 00:00:22.502
That's the extent of my runway knowledge.

00:00:22.502 --> 00:00:23.335
- Is that high fashion?

00:00:23.335 --> 00:00:24.461
- Sure is, Kane.

00:00:24.461 --> 00:00:26.211
- Really interested in the
artistic element to it.

00:00:26.211 --> 00:00:27.989
Where it feels a little
more, like, elevated.

00:00:27.989 --> 00:00:28.896
- It could be a girl laying on the floor

00:00:28.896 --> 00:00:30.015
and you can barely see the outfit,

00:00:30.015 --> 00:00:30.975
but it's high fashion.

00:00:30.975 --> 00:00:32.230
- I know that everyone's probably wearing

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:34.153
very expensive clothing.

00:00:34.153 --> 00:00:35.701
- Couture, I believe, is what it's called.

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:37.911
- They range between naked in a hot tub

00:00:37.911 --> 00:00:38.931
with, like, a necklace

00:00:38.931 --> 00:00:40.571
or a high end apartment.

00:00:40.571 --> 00:00:41.787
- They're all skinny.

00:00:41.787 --> 00:00:43.648
Everyone has crazy bone structure

00:00:43.648 --> 00:00:45.380
and jaw lines in high fashion.

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:47.301
I don't really have that at all.

00:00:47.301 --> 00:00:50.068
- Being confident,
giving a smoldering look.

00:00:50.068 --> 00:00:50.901
(cat meowing)

00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:51.930
- They just look like they don't have

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:52.763
a care in the world.

00:00:52.763 --> 00:00:54.101
They're just like...

00:00:54.101 --> 00:00:55.355
- It looks so effortless.

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:57.856
(upbeat music)

00:00:57.856 --> 00:00:59.105
- I'm excited to see, like, what I learn

00:00:59.105 --> 00:01:01.299
from the photographers and
how well I take direction.

00:01:01.299 --> 00:01:03.337
- I'm gonna look like I'm
farting most of the time.

00:01:03.337 --> 00:01:04.607
(mimics farting)

00:01:04.607 --> 00:01:07.184
- Who knows, maybe, we're
gonna have an anxiety attack.

00:01:07.184 --> 00:01:08.246
- You're gonna kill it.

00:01:08.246 --> 00:01:09.079
(suspenseful music)

00:01:09.079 --> 00:01:10.637
- Hoping that stepping
outside my comfort zone

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:13.020
will maybe open up new
opportunities to looking cool.

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:13.949
- We have great photographers.

00:01:13.949 --> 00:01:15.740
We have great makeup artist here today

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:17.404
that are gonna, hopefully, help us along.

00:01:17.404 --> 00:01:18.400
- My name is Brandon Sosa.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:19.648
- I'm Arthur Galvao.

00:01:19.648 --> 00:01:22.280
Our concept today, we're getting you guys

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:25.185
in a campaign and fashion
brand environment.

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:27.457
- [Brandon] The first set is
kind of inspired by Gucci.

00:01:27.457 --> 00:01:28.491
- Patterns, a lot of colors.

00:01:28.491 --> 00:01:30.366
- Lots of props, busy living room vibe.

00:01:30.366 --> 00:01:32.095
And the other set's going
to be a simple red backdrop.

00:01:32.095 --> 00:01:33.695
Very poppy but a bit more minimal.

00:01:33.695 --> 00:01:35.595
I'm sure there will be
a few challenges today.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:36.725
Sometimes there's preconceived notions

00:01:36.725 --> 00:01:38.536
on how you're suppose
to behave as a model.

00:01:38.536 --> 00:01:41.256
The learning lesson today
will be that less is more.

00:01:41.256 --> 00:01:42.808
(upbeat music)

00:01:42.808 --> 00:01:44.339
- The makeup was a lot crazier than usual,

00:01:44.339 --> 00:01:46.015
just 'cause it's suppose
to be high fashion.

00:01:46.015 --> 00:01:47.840
Our faces are a lot more mannequin like

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.496
'cause it's suppose to be sleek.

00:01:49.496 --> 00:01:51.327
You're supposed to not look real, almost.

00:01:51.327 --> 00:01:52.950
- Something I've never experienced before,

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:55.172
living the life of high end.

00:01:55.172 --> 00:01:56.578
- I couldn't get a babysitter for Marty.

00:01:56.578 --> 00:01:59.136
He came along and we just
incorporated him in the shoot.

00:01:59.136 --> 00:02:00.698
(playful music)

00:02:00.698 --> 00:02:02.815
- I don't think I did any smiling photos

00:02:02.815 --> 00:02:04.640
because that's more commercial.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:06.414
The whole time I was just like,

00:02:06.414 --> 00:02:08.504
alright, who the fuck am I looking at?

00:02:08.504 --> 00:02:09.509
Alright, who's this bitch?

00:02:09.509 --> 00:02:10.593
Okay, yeah.

00:02:10.593 --> 00:02:12.910
- I felt like my face, it can look bored,

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:15.993
and so a lot of times when I look up,

00:02:17.178 --> 00:02:19.137
- The whole time my face
was just saying play dead.

00:02:19.137 --> 00:02:20.418
That was my thought process.

00:02:20.418 --> 00:02:22.238
- I feel very self conscious.

00:02:22.238 --> 00:02:23.405
I have really bad teeth growing up

00:02:23.405 --> 00:02:25.220
so I've never been as comfortable smiling.

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:26.374
So it was really nice in these

00:02:26.374 --> 00:02:28.115
because I just got to
be like dead in the eyes

00:02:28.115 --> 00:02:30.072
which is my natural go-to, anyways.

00:02:30.072 --> 00:02:32.766
High fashion's dead
inside, dead in the eyes.

00:02:32.766 --> 00:02:34.899
- The photographer asked
me, like, give me attitude.

00:02:34.899 --> 00:02:36.958
I was like, no, like.

00:02:36.958 --> 00:02:37.791
- He was like give me attitude.

00:02:37.791 --> 00:02:39.429
So you're like okay and
just walked off the set.

00:02:39.429 --> 00:02:41.483
I think I'm more comfortable
with commercial photography,

00:02:41.483 --> 00:02:43.170
where you're holding
something and you're like...

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:45.732
(laughing)
(intense music)

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:46.662
- I think the hardest part of the day

00:02:46.662 --> 00:02:48.966
was just what to do with my hands.

00:02:48.966 --> 00:02:50.816
- Every little movement matters.

00:02:50.816 --> 00:02:51.649
Questioning like, oh my god,

00:02:51.649 --> 00:02:53.214
I closed my hand, like
do I look over there?

00:02:53.214 --> 00:02:54.125
They were like look more masculine.

00:02:54.125 --> 00:02:55.167
I'm like okay but when you're normally

00:02:55.167 --> 00:02:56.165
sitting in a chair, you're not like,

00:02:56.165 --> 00:02:57.771
do I look masculine, you just sit.

00:02:57.771 --> 00:02:58.604
It was a little bit of a struggle.

00:02:58.604 --> 00:02:59.811
Sitting positions, I
always question myself.

00:02:59.811 --> 00:03:01.203
If I'm gonna look slouchy

00:03:01.203 --> 00:03:02.859
or, like, my legs are gonna look weird.

00:03:02.859 --> 00:03:04.110
- Unconventional poses.

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:05.332
One foot on the couch.

00:03:05.332 --> 00:03:06.810
One foot touching the floor

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:08.274
while I'm holding my suit jacket.

00:03:08.274 --> 00:03:09.907
Everything was, like, what.

00:03:09.907 --> 00:03:12.193
- It made me second guess
all my posing skills.

00:03:12.193 --> 00:03:13.902
You feel like your leg
was in the right place

00:03:13.902 --> 00:03:16.220
but then it comes off weird on camera

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:17.848
so they knew exactly where to put us.

00:03:17.848 --> 00:03:19.993
- Sosa had to tweak me and move me

00:03:19.993 --> 00:03:21.516
exactly where they wanted me

00:03:21.516 --> 00:03:23.437
until they found the right position.

00:03:23.437 --> 00:03:24.270
(funky music)

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.193
- When I first started, I
was a little bit nervous

00:03:26.193 --> 00:03:28.047
and then once we got
those first few shots off,

00:03:28.047 --> 00:03:29.347
I got much more relaxed

00:03:29.347 --> 00:03:30.668
and just felt way more comfortable

00:03:30.668 --> 00:03:32.821
I was able to just give a natural feel.

00:03:32.821 --> 00:03:36.219
Now I know I can do this
or this or even this.

00:03:36.219 --> 00:03:37.879
- You killed it, in the red set.

00:03:37.879 --> 00:03:39.490
You were just like bam, bam, bam,

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:40.684
bam, bam, bam, bam.

00:03:40.684 --> 00:03:41.711
- Yeah, that's just cause they showed

00:03:41.711 --> 00:03:42.934
me what to do and I was just like,

00:03:42.934 --> 00:03:44.196
okay I can do that.

00:03:44.196 --> 00:03:45.600
- He just kinda moved me in a spot

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.321
and I felt like I couldn't move

00:03:47.321 --> 00:03:48.933
and then I saw Jeremy like kill it

00:03:48.933 --> 00:03:50.457
so I wanted to relax more.

00:03:50.457 --> 00:03:53.106
- Poses felt much more rigid and defined,

00:03:53.106 --> 00:03:54.328
which I really enjoyed.

00:03:54.328 --> 00:03:55.326
They were a lot more dramatic.

00:03:55.326 --> 00:03:56.341
- With all these poses,

00:03:56.341 --> 00:03:58.808
you feel a little bizarre and awkward

00:03:58.808 --> 00:04:01.629
but then you see the photo
and you're like, damn.

00:04:01.629 --> 00:04:03.591
(upbeat electronic music)

00:04:03.591 --> 00:04:04.516
- The group shot was crazy.

00:04:04.516 --> 00:04:06.155
It totally looked like we just stepped

00:04:06.155 --> 00:04:08.601
out of a Gucci ad, so like sick.

00:04:08.601 --> 00:04:09.827
- Pose be at its candid.

00:04:09.827 --> 00:04:11.764
Initially he said,
"So-and-so look at so-and-so"

00:04:11.764 --> 00:04:13.451
and we're looking at each other
we couldn't stop laughing.

00:04:13.451 --> 00:04:15.038
It's kinda awkward, you're just
staring at the other person

00:04:15.038 --> 00:04:16.968
across from you.
- It felt awkward but

00:04:16.968 --> 00:04:18.779
when you saw the photo it didn't look like

00:04:18.779 --> 00:04:19.612
you were looking at the person.

00:04:19.612 --> 00:04:20.665
They were very good at communication.

00:04:20.665 --> 00:04:22.096
Sometimes photographers
will just kind of shoot

00:04:22.096 --> 00:04:24.367
and then you're like oh,
do I look good, okay.

00:04:24.367 --> 00:04:25.200
They're taking pictures,

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.872
but it totally like x-ed out
what I was worried about.

00:04:27.872 --> 00:04:29.980
- The composition in the
pictures was really great

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.092
and you could just tell
they put a lot of time

00:04:31.092 --> 00:04:33.497
and effort into the way they posed you

00:04:33.497 --> 00:04:35.663
and the way they shot
it, it was really neat.

00:04:35.663 --> 00:04:37.737
(wind swooshing)
(soft music)

00:04:37.737 --> 00:04:38.570
- I was like, you know what,

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:41.231
I've spent 26 years being inside my head

00:04:41.231 --> 00:04:42.212
and being insecure.

00:04:42.212 --> 00:04:44.292
This new year, I've finally decided

00:04:44.292 --> 00:04:46.602
to just own who the fuck you are,

00:04:46.602 --> 00:04:50.096
have fun with this, and
play, mother fucker.

00:04:50.096 --> 00:04:51.353
- I had no idea what to expect

00:04:51.353 --> 00:04:52.475
when we started shooting these.

00:04:52.475 --> 00:04:53.593
I don't necessarily picture myself

00:04:53.593 --> 00:04:54.601
as a beautiful person,

00:04:54.601 --> 00:04:55.580
but when I saw these photos,

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:57.088
it just came out so good.

00:04:57.088 --> 00:04:58.501
Beyond my wildest imagination.

00:04:58.501 --> 00:04:59.788
I'm going out to the store

00:04:59.788 --> 00:05:03.212
and buying a navy tux today, I'm obsessed.

00:05:03.212 --> 00:05:05.170
- I felt really special.

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.893
Beautiful, I felt like over the top.

00:05:06.893 --> 00:05:09.393
I'm just like don't talk
to me right now, I'm busy.

00:05:09.393 --> 00:05:10.660
- It actually turned out a lot better

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.021
than I thought it would
for like my own photos

00:05:13.021 --> 00:05:14.909
'cause I recently just shaved my head

00:05:14.909 --> 00:05:16.631
and I'm still like
kinda insecure about it.

00:05:16.631 --> 00:05:19.697
Seeing these cool photos,
with my bald head now,

00:05:19.697 --> 00:05:21.569
it makes me more
comfortable about it, too.

00:05:21.569 --> 00:05:22.402
- I enjoyed it.

00:05:22.402 --> 00:05:23.586
They were so good at their job.

00:05:23.586 --> 00:05:25.601
I feel like my self esteem
went up a small rung.

00:05:25.601 --> 00:05:27.916
I might learn to love myself down the road

00:05:27.916 --> 00:05:28.772
but not after today.

00:05:28.772 --> 00:05:30.397
- Do you feel less trash?

00:05:30.397 --> 00:05:31.694
- Less trash?

00:05:31.694 --> 00:05:35.277
- Doing this I was
like, yep, I'm up there.

00:05:36.547 --> 00:05:37.881
I'm definitely still trash

00:05:37.881 --> 00:05:39.646
but I'm like an elevated trash bag

00:05:39.646 --> 00:05:41.343
that can hold anything you put in it.

00:05:41.343 --> 00:05:43.298
- Growing up I was probably a little bit

00:05:43.298 --> 00:05:46.531
intimidated by how men
are perceived in the media

00:05:46.531 --> 00:05:48.532
and how men's bodies look

00:05:48.532 --> 00:05:50.316
and I compared that to myself a lot.

00:05:50.316 --> 00:05:52.407
To be able to own who I am

00:05:52.407 --> 00:05:54.031
and be happy and confident with my body,

00:05:54.031 --> 00:05:55.285
that was really rewarding

00:05:55.285 --> 00:05:56.541
because I proved to myself

00:05:56.541 --> 00:05:58.444
that you don't have to look like Hercules

00:05:58.444 --> 00:06:01.113
to experience something as amazing

00:06:01.113 --> 00:06:02.731
as high fashion photography.

00:06:02.731 --> 00:06:04.141
I'm so used to kind of watching

00:06:04.141 --> 00:06:05.375
and looking behind the scenes

00:06:05.375 --> 00:06:06.844
so it was really fun for me to kind of

00:06:06.844 --> 00:06:09.356
have the opportunity to
be in front of the camera

00:06:09.356 --> 00:06:10.888
and have fun and have some photos

00:06:10.888 --> 00:06:12.629
that I'm gonna cherish
for the rest of my life

00:06:12.629 --> 00:06:14.395
and hopefully someone else
will cherish them too.

00:06:14.395 --> 00:06:15.672
I'm still waiting.

00:06:15.672 --> 00:06:16.618
It was really fun for us.

00:06:16.618 --> 00:06:18.279
We've been doing a lot
of projects together.

00:06:18.279 --> 00:06:19.511
This was the first time we really

00:06:19.511 --> 00:06:21.407
were all put in front of the camera

00:06:21.407 --> 00:06:23.066
at the same time and it was really fun

00:06:23.066 --> 00:06:24.521
to get to kinda like laugh

00:06:24.521 --> 00:06:27.190
and also try new things
with everyone right there.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.201
- [Man] You did slay.

00:06:28.201 --> 00:06:30.073
- [Man] We all did. It
just looks very crisp.

00:06:30.073 --> 00:06:32.966
- Yeah I love how we
all posed individually,

00:06:32.966 --> 00:06:34.868
but overall we're all connected.

00:06:34.868 --> 00:06:36.572
We're not just like holding each other

00:06:36.572 --> 00:06:37.461
or like, you know,

00:06:37.461 --> 00:06:38.978
just like everyone doing their own thing

00:06:38.978 --> 00:06:41.882
but we, magically, look
like we're together.

00:06:41.882 --> 00:06:43.069
- I would totally do this again.

00:06:43.069 --> 00:06:45.031
I 1,000% have a new profile pic.

00:06:45.031 --> 00:06:45.864
I can't wait to post it

00:06:45.864 --> 00:06:47.064
and see these likes roll in.

00:06:47.064 --> 00:06:48.372
- I would definitely try this again

00:06:48.372 --> 00:06:50.289
'cause now that I have bit of experience

00:06:50.289 --> 00:06:52.424
I think it would be a lot
easier the second time.

00:06:52.424 --> 00:06:55.293
Marty was a better high
fashion model than I.

00:06:55.293 --> 00:06:56.521
(laughing)

00:06:56.521 --> 00:06:57.573
- He's better than all of us, actually.

00:06:57.573 --> 00:06:59.266
- With the right team, the sound stage,

00:06:59.266 --> 00:07:01.479
professional photographer,
the hair and makeup,

00:07:01.479 --> 00:07:03.739
wardrobe and all that.
- You can all look good,

00:07:03.739 --> 00:07:05.406
everyone can look...

00:07:07.222 --> 00:07:10.222
(upbeat rock music)

00:07:11.411 --> 00:07:12.244
Maybe.

00:07:22.425 --> 00:07:26.592
(wind swooshing)
(hinge squeaking)

